WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.570
- What did you have to learn to love

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.620
about yourself when you were a kid,

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.300
like other than like your eyebrows

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.710
or weird like aesthetic things,

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.780
but anything like personality-wise.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:09.960
I feel like a lot of creative people

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.730
were always kind of introverted at first.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.940
- I think we all have our
insecurities and for me,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.020
body image was a really big thing

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.820
and I've been very vocal and
open about my experiences

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.740
with eating disorders and just how, now,

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.470
my fiance is so supportive

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.810
and it's like finding
new ways to feel centered

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:30.160
and not reverting back to old ways.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.580
And it's, I think it's so admirable

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.470
for both of you to be
such strong advocates

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.570
of talking about things

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.480
that a lot of people think
are taboo or shameful.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.810
It's like, we all just need to say

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.370
that we all go through these
things and we're not crazy

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.830
and no one of us is alone, you know?

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.800
And I just think that we all
have those little things.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.090
- Yeah, and I also think that were always,

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.740
I literally just was talking

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:54.680
about this yesterday with someone.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.777
I was like, "Well, I'm
always like working on

00:00:57.777 --> 00:00:59.840
"being the better version
of myself, for the bet,"

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:00.673
you know what I'm saying?

00:01:00.673 --> 00:01:01.700
There's always gotta be
a better, I don't know,

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.890
I like progressing or whatever.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:03.868
So, I always think
- No for sure, for sure.

00:01:03.868 --> 00:01:05.910
- That therapy is so good for everybody.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:07.880
- It's one of the good things
now about social media.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.770
There's so many bad things, I think,

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:10.880
that make us feel isolated

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.380
about like technology and social media,

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.800
but actually to that point,
like breaking that taboo,

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.967
the more people reach out and say,

00:01:15.967 --> 00:01:17.280
"Hey, I'm feeling this way."

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.870
And then you feel that swell of love,

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.170
whether you're in the public eye or not,

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:21.377
to say, like "I've been there.

00:01:21.377 --> 00:01:23.360
"I know what you feel like."

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.300
There's actually been a
really amazing community

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.690
of people to say, like "I got you"

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.730
and that's been a cool thing to see.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.310
- Yeah.
- That's amazing, Josh,

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.970
because that's actually the community

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:34.720
that I've found on my
social media platforms

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.440
which inspired me to write my book

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.260
because all these people
were reaching out,

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.600
talking about their insecurities

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.067
and prefacing it by saying,
"Oh, but you're an actress.

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.120
"You probably have no idea
what I'm talking about."

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.387
And I'm thinking, "I'm an actress

00:01:45.387 --> 00:01:47.827
"and I know 100% what you're talking about

00:01:47.827 --> 00:01:49.350
"and let me tell you why."

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.900
And it just inspired me
to then share my story

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:54.170
because none of us are
above sharing our stories.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.270
- Absolutely.
- Yeah.

